### === HEALTH ===
### Проверка здоровья -> 200 {"status": "ok"}
GET http://localhost:8000/health


### === СОЗДАНИЕ ===
### Создать мероприятие -> 201
POST http://localhost:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python Meetup",
  "date": "2025-12-15T19:00:00",
  "location": "Коворкинг Центр",
  "capacity": 50
}

### Создать второе -> 201
POST http://localhost:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Хакатон",
  "date": "2026-01-20T10:00:00",
  "location": "Кампус",
  "capacity": 100
}


### === ПОЛУЧЕНИЕ ===
### Список всех -> 200
GET http://localhost:8000/api/events

### Получить по ID -> 200
GET http://localhost:8000/api/events/1

### Неизвестный ID -> 404
GET http://localhost:8000/api/events/999


### === ОБНОВЛЕНИЕ ===
### Полная замена (PUT) -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/events/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python Meetup Updated",
  "date": "2025-12-15T19:00:00",
  "location": "Новое место",
  "capacity": 80
}

### Частичное обновление (PATCH) -> 200
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/events/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 120
}

### PUT несуществующего -> 404
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/events/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Нет такого",
  "date": "2025-01-01",
  "location": "Где-то",
  "capacity": 10
}

### PATCH несуществующего -> 404
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/events/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 50
}


### === УДАЛЕНИЕ ===
### Удалить -> 204 (пустой ответ)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/events/2

### После удаления -> 404
GET http://localhost:8000/api/events/2

### Повторное удаление -> 404
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/events/2


### === ОШИБКИ ВАЛИДАЦИИ (должны давать 400) ===
### Пустой title -> 400
POST http://localhost:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "date": "2025-12-15T19:00:00",
  "location": "Офис",
  "capacity": 50
}

### Пустой location -> 400
POST http://localhost:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Тест",
  "date": "2025-12-15T19:00:00",
  "location": "   ",
  "capacity": 50
}

### Отрицательный capacity -> 400
POST http://localhost:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Тест",
  "date": "2025-12-15T19:00:00",
  "location": "Офис",
  "capacity": -1
}

### Отсутствует обязательное поле -> 400
POST http://localhost:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Без capacity",
  "date": "2025-12-15T19:00:00",
  "location": "Офис"
}

### Битый JSON -> 400
POST http://localhost:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Сломанный", "date":